00:08:46.960 --> 00:08:48.970
A wounded kaiju.

00:08:48.970 --> 00:08:50.730
Gotta be careful...

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:51.550
Hey, wait!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:08:58.560
