00:10:49.880 --> 00:10:52.210
The shape of the future...

00:10:54.070 --> 00:10:58.170
I felt like I witnessed alchemy at 
the Archetype announcement conference.

00:10:58.170 --> 00:11:03.430
I got hold of the photo, but what do you 
think the object in the photo with Ashihara is?

00:11:03.430 --> 00:11:07.230
Since when did <i>you</i> become qualified to quiz me like this?

00:11:07.580 --> 00:11:09.060
Those bones I mentioned...

00:11:09.060 --> 00:11:12.890
This means Misakioku was 
researching them, just as I thought.

00:11:13.390 --> 00:11:14.450
Bones?

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:15.740
This is just a guess.

00:11:15.740 --> 00:11:20.370
What if Archetype and those bones are related?

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:28.380
Our country also found the co-funding of the 
Archetype research venture to be appealing.

00:11:28.380 --> 00:11:31.130
Circumstances are also working in our favor.

00:11:31.130 --> 00:11:34.420
We don't want to rush things, 
but we hope to be met with a positive response.

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:37.010
I hear construction of the 
plant in India is almost complete.

00:11:37.720 --> 00:11:40.300
I would love for you to come visit.

00:11:40.300 --> 00:11:44.900
By the way, our researcher has expressed 
interest in the red dust found on the Rodan,

00:11:44.900 --> 00:11:48.770
which he supposes is similar to Archetype's material.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:49.960
The red dust?

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:54.320
To be frank, the primary raw material 
in Archetype is quite special.

00:11:54.320 --> 00:11:57.150
So special that its mining locations
are few and far between.

00:11:57.150 --> 00:12:01.780
Circumstances permitting, 
we would love to share our intel.

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:05.080
Are you claiming the Rodan appear 
by flying from veins of Archetype?

00:12:05.080 --> 00:12:08.360
That is a possibility we can consider.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.800
A customer at the camp said they saw a big 
shadow at the garbage disposal in the middle of the night!

00:12:12.800 --> 00:12:15.170
It's a big hedgehog, you shouldn't look at it!

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:18.470
It could eat you. Did you get eaten?

00:12:16.800 --> 00:12:18.470
It's not a boar.

00:12:18.470 --> 00:12:21.840
It's neither a deer nor muntjac. It's more of an armadillo.

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.180
Hell, I thought I heard a noise, 
and then in the blink of an eye...

00:12:24.180 --> 00:12:28.100
It had giant needles and made a loud noise like a train.

00:12:28.100 --> 00:12:29.470
What happened afterwards?

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:33.450
I heard from the government 
that they'll hunt for it in the mountains,

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:36.320
but can you really catch something like that?

00:12:36.320 --> 00:12:37.950
A mountain hunt?

