00:18:29.880 --> 00:18:33.930
It seems to pertain to the characteristics of a 
special molecule originating from jellyfish.

00:18:33.930 --> 00:18:36.140
There's no evidence of it being used in practice,

00:18:36.140 --> 00:18:38.900
and the company was bought soon after.

00:18:38.900 --> 00:18:44.270
On top of that, Ashihara's name was among the 
founding members for the company that managed the patent.

00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.270
Archetype Inc.

00:18:47.270 --> 00:18:50.690
The company is now affiliated with SHIVA Consortium.

00:18:50.690 --> 00:18:53.090
They're the bunch Ms. Kanoko is meeting up with.

00:18:53.720 --> 00:18:56.200
From a consortium to Misakioku,

00:18:56.200 --> 00:19:00.660
and from Misakioku's founding member 
to a London pharmaceutical.

00:19:01.020 --> 00:19:02.540
The problem is this.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:04.870
SHIVA was founded 50 years ago,

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:09.670
and it was also 50 years ago
that SHIVA purchased Archetype Inc.

00:19:09.670 --> 00:19:14.100
60 years ago, Ashihara founded Archetype Inc...

00:19:14.590 --> 00:19:16.180
So that came first?

00:19:16.180 --> 00:19:19.850
Regardless of which was first, there's the possibility that

00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:22.680
Archetype Inc was the 
parent company of SHIVA Consortium.

00:19:23.130 --> 00:19:25.940
Give him an inch and he'll take a yard, huh?

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:28.690
Could it be that Ashihara himself founded SHIVA?

00:19:28.690 --> 00:19:35.290
That's the large facility SHIVA Consortium 
is constructing in Upala, India.

00:19:38.010 --> 00:19:40.280
You had someone help you, eh?

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.950
We had to pay up... for that info...

00:19:58.840 --> 00:20:01.430
I heard Manda didn't react to the signal.

00:20:01.430 --> 00:20:04.030
Would the signal reach under the sea?

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:08.400
There's a slim chance that every 
kaiju gets lured by the signal, too.

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:11.060
If Rodan is the radio wave kaiju, Anguirus is...

00:20:11.310 --> 00:20:12.990
The ricochet Kaiju?

00:20:12.990 --> 00:20:14.990
Or the future-predicting kaiju?

00:20:20.530 --> 00:20:21.720
We've been hit!

00:20:22.200 --> 00:20:24.600
Angu—reflected the bu—

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:25.540
What happened?

00:20:25.540 --> 00:20:28.500
Hey! This is headquarters! Respond!

00:20:27.500 --> 00:20:30.040
There! By the edge of the course!

00:20:35.340 --> 00:20:36.630
They came back!

00:20:36.630 --> 00:20:38.020
What happened?

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:46.980
It grew bigger!

00:20:46.980 --> 00:20:49.390
That cage is hardly a proper fit for it.

00:20:49.390 --> 00:20:50.400
How's Gramps?

00:20:50.400 --> 00:20:51.990
Doesn't seem like he's noticed it yet.

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:54.300
Let's contact him through the radio.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:03.330
This is bad! They'll get caught!

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:04.930
Look! That truck!

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:11.250
A harpoon cannon? Will that even work?

00:21:11.500 --> 00:21:14.790
Do it, Mr. Gen! Blast away!

00:21:15.880 --> 00:21:18.130
Go left!

00:21:20.050 --> 00:21:22.530
Take this...!

00:21:30.190 --> 00:21:32.560
That harpoon's loaded with gunpowder!?

00:21:38.320 --> 00:21:39.900
We missed it.

00:21:39.900 --> 00:21:42.240
Hurry and load the next one!

00:21:49.710 --> 00:21:51.250
Outaki!

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:53.960
Good grief. I warned you, didn't I?

00:21:53.960 --> 00:21:56.510
Rest there for a bit.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:00.290
This is no time to sit and stare all brazenly,

00:22:01.040 --> 00:22:04.970
for Jet Jaguar will now destroy you!

00:22:06.520 --> 00:22:12.270
<b>I woke up to your voice that painted my vision with color</b>

00:22:12.270 --> 00:22:18.150
<b>And it was the same shade of curiosity I find in my familiar daily life</b>

00:22:18.150 --> 00:22:23.530
<b>If this feeling can grow naturally on its own</b>

00:22:23.530 --> 00:22:29.410
<b>Will it fall off one day like an unripe fruit, I wonder? </b>

00:22:30.080 --> 00:22:34.040
<b>I don't know anything</b>

00:22:34.040 --> 00:22:38.420
<b>Not even anything about you</b>

00:22:41.300 --> 00:22:46.930
<b>Let me keep on dreaming for now</b>

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:51.310
<b>If this moment is all I have now</b>

00:22:51.770 --> 00:22:55.770
<b>I can still feel the warmth in my palm</b>

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:03.030
<b>My thrumming feelings open and burst out</b>

00:23:03.030 --> 00:23:07.040
<b>I want to keep learning more, like I am now</b>

00:23:08.790 --> 00:23:13.580
<b>This pulsating rhythm I feel just won't stop</b>

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:14.540
<b>It won't stop</b>
